00:08:53.141 --> 00:08:54.303
That's how it works.

00:08:54.303 --> 00:08:57.400
You need this cholesterol to build

00:08:57.400 --> 00:08:59.544
the surrounding around all your cells.

00:08:59.544 --> 00:09:02.297
