00:09:18.789 --> 00:09:21.143
to equal what your body
makes every single day.

00:09:21.143 --> 00:09:23.517
But it adapts, so you eat
less, your body makes more.

00:09:23.517 --> 00:09:26.218
You eat more, your body makes less.

00:09:26.218 --> 00:09:30.385
Now, 65 to 80% of your body
should be in the form of fat.

